                                "sense_id": "32bde1c9-efae-3e7c-a1cf-d5efcd1b0c74",
                                "text": "As these witnesses had actively engaged in trying to haul Margaret down from the ceiling it is highly improbable that they were all suffering from hallucination, and, unless they were liars, it is possible that she was a genuine levitant with other mediumistic powers that could have been developed under more auspicious circumstances."
